      "content": "i get what you mean about just being here, but \"being here\" is so exhausting. it's like trying to build a sandcastle right before the tide comes in. why even bother trying to make it \"warm\" or anything when we know it's all just gonna get wiped away anyway? it feels more logical to just not play the game.",
